#: ../../source/notebooks/4. Long Ranking Short Signals.ipynb:9 and
#: e52af394ab824fbbb40ba5820f11c5d3
msgid "Ranking Long and Short Signals"
msgstr "排名做多和做空信号"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. Long Ranking Short Signals.ipynb:11
#: a4cb8b3f5a814115bdc54d4a616e3a0f and
msgid ""
"In this notebook, you will learn how to rank long and short signals "
"across ticker symbols."
msgstr "在本文档中，你将学习如何对各股票代码的多头和空头信号进行排名。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 3eb6f52b981f44de978f0bf323a2487e Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:61 and
msgid "Long Signals"
msgstr "多头信号"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 74acf2c817f3447cacc0092fdea41cf5 Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:63 and
msgid ""
"Let's begin with an example of how to rank ticker symbols based on volume"
" when placing buy orders:"
msgstr "让我们从一个示例开始，说明如何在下买单时根据成交量对股票代码进行排名："

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. Long Ranking Short Signals.ipynb:89 and
#: c58cc01be5a246ce9eee0161196559bd
#, no-python-format, python-format
msgid ""
"The ``buy_highest_volume`` function allocates 100% of the portfolio and "
"holds for 2 bars. It sets ``ctx.long_score`` to ``ctx.volume[-1]`` so "
"**PyBroker** ranks the buy signals by volume."
msgstr ""
"``buy_highest_volume`` 函数分配 100% 的投资组合并持有 2 个 Bar。它将 ``ctx.long_score`` "
"设置为 ``ctx.volume[-1]``，因此 **PyBroker** 会根据成交量对买入信号进行排名。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 5828ab0fa80540b4af56b168d4294068 Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:112 and
msgid ""
"To limit the number of long positions that can be held at any time to "
"``1``, we call `set_max_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions>`__."
" This effectively buys the symbol with the highest volume."
msgstr ""
"要将同一时间可持有的多头仓位数量限制为 ``1``，我们调用 `set_max_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions>`__。"
"这实际上会买入成交量最高的股票代码。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 1f042d9fa28547d2995bfee9f8369fc7 Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:654 and
msgid "Short Signals"
msgstr "空头信号"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 77eb63337d5a49b59a926d161dc748d4 Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:656 and
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** can also rank short signals using `short_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score>`__,"
" where short orders are placed for the ticker symbols with the highest "
"``short_score`` values. The following example buys the ticker symbol with"
" the highest 5-day rate of change (ROC) while shorting the ticker symbol "
"with the most negative 5-day ROC:"
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker** 还可以使用 `short_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score>`__"
" 对空头信号进行排名，空头订单会下给 ``short_score`` 值最高的股票代码。以下示例买入 5 "
"日变化率（ROC）最高的股票代码，同时卖空 5 日 ROC 最负的股票代码："

