"`In the next notebook, we will discuss how to implement custom indicators"
" in PyBroker "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/5.%20Writing%20Indicators.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"`在下一篇文档中，我们将讨论如何在 PyBroker 中实现自定义指标 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/5.%20Writing%20Indicators.html>`__。"

